  landmarkIdentity: Basalt Steps reads through spires, steps, and big natural crowns.
    Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: bad drops and exposed lines. Creature pressure
    stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Targeted node work along long rock lines and exposed shelves.
    Early tier: keep runs short and favor stone pockets and hard-form nodes.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is main ridge line. This slot should read through
    spine tooth, fin, or slab seam; use vertical forms to keep heading.
